    <!-- Modern Hero Section -->
    <section class="modern-hero">
      <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Welcome to Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School</h1>
        <p>
          Where every child's journey is met with compassion, dedication, and a commitment to excellence. Nestled in the heart of Udu, Delta State, our school stands as a beacon of hope and opportunity for children with neurological disorders and their families.
        </p>
        <a href="#about" class="hero-btn">Learn More</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="/img/b41.jpg" alt="School Hero Image" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mantra Banner -->
    <section class="mantra-banner">
      <span>Disability is not Inability</span>
    </section>

    <!-- About / Mission Section -->
    <section class="about-section" id="about">
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>About Our School</h2>
        <p>
          Founded on the principles of inclusivity and empowerment, Comrade David Ofoeyeno Special School is more than just an educational institution — it's a community dedicated to unlocking the full potential of every child, regardless of their challenges. Named in honor of Comrade David Ofoeyeno, a visionary leader and advocate for children with special needs, our school embodies his spirit of resilience, compassion, and unwavering belief in the power of education to transform lives.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our mission is simple yet profound: to provide a nurturing and inclusive environment where each student can thrive academically, socially, and emotionally. We foster a culture of acceptance, understanding, and respect, where differences are celebrated and every child is valued for who they are.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Vision Section -->
    <section class="vision-section">
      <div class="vision-text">
        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>
          At our school, we believe in a holistic approach to education that recognizes the unique strengths, abilities, and challenges of each student. Through individualized learning plans, evidence-based practices, and a focus on meaningful outcomes, we empower students to reach their full potential and become active participants in their own learning journey.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="vision-image">
        <img src="/img/s9.jpg" alt="Students learning together">
      </div>
    </section>

